---
description: Reuse existing FireAnt implementation before creating new data-access logic
alwaysApply: true
---

Before writing any new market-data code:
- search the repo for:
  - fireant
  - FIREANT_TOKEN
  - token
  - restv2.fireant.vn
  - historical-quotes
  - all-financial-data
  - full-financial-reports
  - industries
  - icb
- prefer reusing existing wrappers, retry logic, normalizers, and proxy resolvers
- avoid duplicate clients or inconsistent schemas
- if existing implementation is incomplete, extend it instead of creating parallel code

